# Netlify/Cloudflare Pages-style headers. Other hosts need equivalent settings.
# Hosts negotiate compression themselves. Build adds explicit HTML and asset
# rules to avoid overlapping wildcard Cache-Control values on these platforms.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/assets/build/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/responsive/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
